      "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Discover the</span> power <span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">of the SKILL</span> Centers of Excellence</span></span></span></span></p>\n",
