      "jcr:created": "Wed May 13 2020 13:49:52 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">“These days, young neurointerventionalists may believe that YouTube is the best teaching tool in INR. YouTube is great for cooking. The Stryker SKILL Centers of Excellence program is great for teaching neurointervention.‘’</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Dr. Istvan Szikora<br>\n National Institute of Neuroscience, Budapest Hungary</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
